<title>THAILAND: Sahaviriya Steel Q3 net loss up sharply.</title>
<headline>Sahaviriya Steel Q3 net loss up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	(1.01)    vs     loss     (0.36)</p>
<p>    Net	   loss    (515.42)    vs     loss   (182.95)</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	(3.21)    vs    profit     0.24</p>
<p>    Net	   loss  (1,639.41)    vs    profit   120.70</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Sahaviriya Steel Industry Plc, a steel mill operator.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
